{
  "description": "What the References panel's filters keep (`compile_backlink_filters`, `agaric-store/src/backlink/filters.rs`), which `query_backlinks_grouped.json` leaves unpinned. Five sources link to page B1: B4, B5 and B6 on page Alpha, B7 on page Beta and B8 nested under B7. A task's state and priority live in their `blocks` columns, so `TodoState` and `Priority` read the column, and the Status and Priority `none` options (`Not` of an `Or` of every value) keep the blocks with no value. `SourcePage` walks `parent_id` from the named blocks, so excluding a page drops its nested blocks and excluding a block drops its subtree. `HasTag` and `HasTagPrefix` match an attached tag (B6) and an inline `#[id]` (B8); `PropertyIsSet` / `PropertyIsEmpty` read `block_properties`. An empty `Or` matches nothing, and `Not` of an empty `And` matches everything. Re-author `expected` via CONFORMANCE_UPDATE=1.",
